  "name": "Spellbinder",
  "type": "subclass",
  "img": "modules/grimnir-lyonesse/assets/icons/lorc-crossed-chains.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your power was not learned but stolen through cunning and the reckless violation of ancient taboos. Perhaps you were once trained in the rigid disciplines of the Hellbinders, but you went further. Where they bound their servants with magical law, you stole true names and wove your own chains of command. You are a Spellbinder, a Wizard who commands the unwilling and turns defiance into obedience. Each creature you summon is not a fleeting conjuration but a bound soul, sealed within a magical relic known as an Amulet of Binding. You brand them with your essence, call them forth again and again, and in time, they come to know you, and fear you.</p>"
    },
